{{Documentation/Header}}
{{High Risk}}
{{Lua|Exists}}
This template checks for a page's existence without causing the page to show up on whatlinkshere and wantedpages, unlike #ifexist.

==Syntax==
{{T|Exists|v1=page to check|v2=content if exists|v3=content if does not exist}}

==Examples==
{{T|Exists|This page does not exist|true|false|_Y_=1}}<br>
{{T|Exists|Venti|true|false|_Y_=1}}<br>
{{T|Exists|v1=blank|p2=true|p3=false|_Y_=1}}

